{"pageProps":{"source":"Une distorsion cognitive est une pensée ou une croyance irrationnelle qui influence la façon dont une personne perçoit la réalité.\n\n<p>C'est un concept clé de la <a href=\"/tcc\" title=\"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale\">Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale</a></p>\n\n\n<p>C'est une <a href=\"/pensee-automatique\" title=\"Pensée automatique\">Pensée automatique</a> qui nous détournent de la réalité.</p>\n\n\nVoici une liste de distorsions cognitives :\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/pensee-tout-ou-rien\" title=\"Pensée tout ou rien\">Pensée tout ou rien</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/generalisation-excessive\" title=\"Overgeneralization\">Overgeneralization</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/inference-arbitraire\" title=\"Inférence arbitraire\">Inférence arbitraire</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/lecture-de-pensee\" title=\"Lecture de pensée\">Lecture de pensée</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/erreur-de-prediction\" title=\"L'erreur de prédiction\">L'erreur de prédiction</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/labelling\" title=\"Labelling\" class=\"not-found\">Labelling</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/personalization\" title=\"Personalization\" class=\"not-found\">Personalization</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/emotional-reasoning\" title=\"Emotional Reasoning\" class=\"not-found\">Emotional Reasoning</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/pensee-magique\" title=\"Pensée magique\" class=\"not-found\">Pensée magique</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/magnification\" title=\"Magnification\" class=\"not-found\">Magnification</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/fausses-obligations\" title=\"Fausses obligations\" class=\"not-found\">Fausses obligations</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/disqualification-du-positif\" title=\"Disqualification du positif\" class=\"not-found\">Disqualification du positif</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/mental-filter\" title=\"Mental filter\" class=\"not-found\">Mental filter</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/always-being-right\" title=\"Always being right\" class=\"not-found\">Always being right</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/blaming\" title=\"Blaming\" class=\"not-found\">Blaming</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/fallacy-of-change\" title=\"Fallacy of change\" class=\"not-found\">Fallacy of change</a></p>\n\n\n***\n\nRéférences :\n\n*   <https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Distorsion_cognitive>\n*   <https://reddit.com/r/LifeProTips/comments/tdxt4s/lpt_be_super_careful_about_how_you_speak_to/>\n*   <https://therapistaid.com/worksheets/cognitive-distortions>\n*   <https://psychomedia.qc.ca/psychologie-cognitive/2013-03-14/distorsions-cognitives-liste-definitions>\n*   <https://sdlab.fas.harvard.edu/cognitive-reappraisal/identifying-negative-automatic-thought-patterns>\n*   <https://mindmypeelings.com/s/cognitive-distortions-list-infographic.pdf>\n*   <https://publish.obsidian.md/max/Distorted+thinking>\n*   <https://psychcentral.com/lib/cognitive-distortions-negative-thinking>\n*   <https://belmontwellness.com/wp-content/uploads/Handout-2.3-Examples-of-Depression-and-Anxiety-Producing-Cognitive-Distortions.pdf>\n","isIndex":false,"graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"Distorsion cognitive","title":"Distorsion cognitive","href":"/distorsion-cognitive","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Inférence arbitraire","title":"Inférence arbitraire","href":"/inference-arbitraire","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"L'erreur de prédiction","title":"L'erreur de prédiction","href":"/erreur-de-prediction","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Lecture de pensée","title":"Lecture de pensée","href":"/lecture-de-pensee","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Overgeneralization","title":"Généralisation excessive","href":"/generalisation-excessive","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Pensée automatique","title":"Pensée automatique","href":"/pensee-automatique","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Pensée tout ou rien","title":"Pensée tout ou rien","href":"/pensee-tout-ou-rien","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Psychologie","title":"🧠 Psychologie","href":"/psychologie","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale","title":"Thérapie cogn